<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Palmdale Civic Auth, Calif..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Palmdale Civic Auth, Calif..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Connor &amp; Company Securities said it received the verbal award for $7.230 million of Palmdale Civic Authority, Calif., 1997 limited obligation revenue bonds, with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2007.</p>
